              </a>
              <a href="/blog/eu-ai-act-audit-trails" class="group flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-ink-1 hover:text-ink-1 transition-colors leading-relaxed">
                <span class="font-mono text-warn shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform">→</span>
                <span>What the EU AI Act Actually Requires for Audit Trails, And What Most Enterprises Are Missing</span>
              </a>
